<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 2.5 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 2.5 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International said the following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 2.516 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>* British Petroleum Company		  5.25  6.56     2.171</p>
<p>* British Sky Broadcasting		   2.75  3.44     0.345</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
